<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia prices flat to slightly higher.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia prices flat to slightly higher.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate and ammonia prices were flat to slightly higher in moderate dealings Monday. More buying activity from China is needed to sustain current prices, trade sources said.</p>
<p>			   Dlrs/short ton	  Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   174-178			unc-up 2</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     182-185			unc-up 1</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		 225			unc</p>
<p>--(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
